        "created_at": "2024-05-14T14:10:27.375Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Seems like it could be a wild ride.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-282-writers-room-a-day-in-the-life-fanatic\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-282-writers-room-a-day-in-the-life-fanatic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e8f0e30642cb431fc91f2966c42fc88c50d9fcb5.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-282-writers-room-a-day-in-the-life-fanatic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #282 - Writers' Room: A Day In The Life: Fanatic</a></h3>\n\n  <p>She's winging in for some stories!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:57:33 We delve into just who in Fanatic's supporting cast is around in the mid-80s, and find some small hopes, at least! Then, we tell some tales. Fanatic's a complicated character,...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/cf0a515167300acc9a7bfba13550ccbfa83f4294.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/cf0a515167300acc9a7bfba13550ccbfa83f4294\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cf0a515167300acc9a7bfba13550ccbfa83f4294_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"txyWort1ILJhbOsjEk0LQ0b5pWs\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cf0a515167300acc9a7bfba13550ccbfa83f4294_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cf0a515167300acc9a7bfba13550ccbfa83f4294_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cf0a515167300acc9a7bfba13550ccbfa83f4294_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cf0a515167300acc9a7bfba13550ccbfa83f4294_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2977 929 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
